{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a unofficial fangame of the Touhou Project series. It is permitted under the official guidelines. Please support the official releases, some of which are available on Steam!</strong><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><strong>Stop time and decimate your foes! In 3d!!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864010/extras/c575bc246fc6b492568e81e05a6573fa.poster.avif?t=1753488904\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864010/extras/c575bc246fc6b492568e81e05a6573fa.webm?t=1753488904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864010/extras/c575bc246fc6b492568e81e05a6573fa.mp4?t=1753488904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Heart-pounding FPS gameplay with bullet hell elements! No cheap enemies, just pure skill! </strong><br><br><strong>Breathtaking landscapes and battlefields, perfectly realized in full jaw-dropping 3d!</strong><br><br><strong>Gorgeous 3d models that will almost make you feel bad for shooting at them! </strong><br><br><strong>Adrenaline inducing soundtrack to keep your blood pumping throughout the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Unforgettable weapons such as the Cirno plush doll!\u00a0<br><br>WE HAVE A TRI-BARRELED SHOTGUN!</strong><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>After losing to one of the Watasuki sister's during the moon rabbit incident, Sakuya is unable to find peace until she exacts her revenge. With the help of a certain blue haired kappa, she teleports herself onto the moon and begins her quest for vengeance. </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864010?t=1753488904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steams